gText_WouldYouLikeToRestYourPkmn::
	.string "Hello, and welcome to\n"
	.string "the POKéMON CENTER.\p"
	.string "We restore your tired POKéMON\n"
	.string "to full health.\p"
	.string "Would you like to rest your POKéMON?$"

gText_IllTakeYourPkmn::
	.string "Thank you for waiting.$"

gText_RestoredPkmnToFullHealth::
	.string "Thank you for waiting.\p"
	.string "We've restored your POKéMON\n"
	.string "to full health.$"

gText_WeHopeToSeeYouAgain::
	.string "We hope to see you again!$"

gText_WelcomeCutShort::
	.string "Hello, and welcome to\n"
	.string "the POKéMON CENTER.\p"
	.string "We restore your tired POKéMON\n"
	.string "to full health.\p"
	.string "Would you like to…$"

gText_NoticesGoldCard::
	.string "Th-that card…\n"
	.string "Could it be… The GOLD CARD?!\p"
	.string "Oh, the gold color is brilliant!\n"
	.string "The four stars seem to sparkle!\p"
	.string "I've seen several TRAINERS with\n"
	.string "a SILVER CARD before, but, {PLAYER},\l"
	.string "you're the first TRAINER I've ever\l"
	.string "seen with a GOLD CARD!\p"
	.string "Okay, {PLAYER}, please allow me\n"
	.string "the honor of resting your POKéMON!$"

gText_YouWantTheUsual::
	.string "I'm delighted to see you, {PLAYER}!\n"
	.string "You want the usual, am I right?$"

gText_IllTakeYourPkmn2::
	.string "Thank you for waiting.$"

gText_ThankYouForWaiting::
	.string "Thank you for waiting.$"

gText_WeHopeToSeeYouAgain2::
	.string "We hope to see you again!$"

@ Random dialogue pool for repeated visits (6+ heals before beating a gym)
@ 100 options, at least 9 lines each, progressively longer - discouraging overuse

gText_NurseRandom_0::
	.string "Oh, so it's you again. You know,\n"
	.string "I just cleaned the counter.\p"
	.string "I reorganized the supplies\n"
	.string "by color instead of size\l"
	.string "this time around.\p"
	.string "It looks much better, I think.\n"
	.string "Anyway, your team is all\l"
	.string "healed up now. Do try\l"
	.string "to be careful out there.$"

gText_NurseRandom_1::
	.string "Welcome back. Did you see\n"
	.string "the weather outside today?\p"
	.string "I think it might rain soon.\n"
	.string "I keep a spare umbrella\l"
	.string "behind the desk, just in case.\p"
	.string "Anyway, your team is ready.\n"
	.string "Try not to get caught in\l"
	.string "any sudden downpours.\l"
	.string "Stay dry out there.$"

gText_NurseRandom_2::
	.string "Oh, careful on the way out.\n"
	.string "We just mopped the floors.\p"
	.string "This new cleaner just came\n"
	.string "that is supposed to be\l"
	.string "really effective.\p"
	.string "I guess the tiles do look shinier.\n"
	.string "Well, your team is healed.\l"
	.string "Watch your step, the\l"
	.string "floor might be slippery.$"

gText_NurseRandom_3::
	.string "Hey again. We just got a\n"
	.string "new batch of medical kits.\p"
	.string "I need to inventory\n"
	.string "them all before my shift\l"
	.string "ends later tonight.\p"
	.string "It is honestly a ridiculous\n"
	.string "amount of boxes. Anyway, your team\l"
	.string "is good to go. I should\l"
	.string "get back to it.$"

gText_NurseRandom_4::
	.string "Oh, hello. Did you see the\n"
	.string "map on the wall? It is new.\p"
	.string "The old one was stained from\n"
	.string "where someone sneased on it.\l"
	.string "Drove meabsolutely crazy.\p"
	.string "This new one is clean though!\n"
	.string "Feel free to check if\l"
	.string "you don't believe me.\p"
	.string "Anyway, you are all set.\l"
	.string "Have a safe trip.$"

gText_NurseRandom_5::
	.string "Welcome back! You know, I\n"
	.string "had to change a lightbulb.\p"
	.string "The one above the machine\n"
	.string "kept flickering all day.\l"
	.string "It was pretty distracting.\p"
	.string "But wanna know what the worst\n"
	.string "part of it was?\l"
	.string "We actually don't have a ladder\n"
	.string "here at the Pokemon Center.\l"
	.string "So I had to climb up and stand\n"
	.string "on a CHANSEY to change it!\p"
	.string "Your team is all healed.\l"
	.string "Off you go then.$"

gText_NurseRandom_6::
	.string "Oh hey. I was just reading\n"
	.string "the magazines in the lobby.\p"
	.string "We should really update them\n"
	.string "I want to say the newest one is\l"
	.string "from like three years ago.\p"
	.string "Anyway, I just finished\n"
	.string "healing your whole team.\l"
	.string "They are looking good.\l"
	.string "Try to stay out of trouble.$"

gText_NurseRandom_7::
	.string "You know what bugs me?\n"
	.string "The door hinge.\p"
	.string "It has been using SCREECH\n"
	.string "all week long.\l"
	.string "I put in a maintenance request.\p"
	.string "But here I am, still waiting.\n"
	.string "Typical of a corporation.\p"
	.string "Your POKeMON are fully healed.\p"
	.string "Take care now, okay?$"

gText_NurseRandom_8::
	.string "Hello, again. Look, I got\n"
	.string "new pens for the counter.\p"
	.string "The old ones kept running\n"
	.string "out of ink at the worst\l"
	.string "possible moments.\p"
	.string "Why did I put a SUNKERN\n"
	.string "eraser on there?\p"
	.string "Oh, I taped it to the pen\l"
	.string "so that it wouldn't get stolen.\p"
	.string "But yeah, you are healed.\l"
	.string "Good luck out there.$"

gText_NurseRandom_9::
	.string "Hi. Someone brought donuts\n"
	.string "to the break room today.\p"
	.string "I wanted the chocolate\n"
	.string "one but CHANSEY got to\l"
	.string "it first, somehow.\p"
	.string "So tomorrow I'll be bringing\n"
	.string "some toothpaste filled ones.\p"
	.string "Hope CHANSEY likes minty fresh!$"

gText_NurseRandom_10::
	.string "Oh hey, you are back. My\n"
	.string "shift ends in two hours.\p"
	.string "I have been here since six\n"
	.string "this morning, actually.\l"
	.string "Long day, you know?\p"
	.string "The night nurse takes\n"
	.string "over after me. She is\l"
	.string "nice enough, I guess.\p"
	.string "Your team is all healed.\l"
	.string "Stay safe out there.$"

gText_NurseRandom_11::
	.string "Welcome back! You've actually come\n"
	.string "at the perfect time! Earlier there\l"
	.string "was an issue with the machine.\p"
	.string "It froze up earlier when\n"
	.string "another TRAINER came in\l"
	.string "with a full team of six.\p"
	.string "Had to unplug it and plug\n"
	.string "it back in. Classic fix.\l"
	.string "Works every single time.\p"
	.string "All done with your team.\l"
	.string "Should be good as new.$"

gText_NurseRandom_12::
	.string "Oh hey. The supply truck\n"
	.string "was late this morning.\p"
	.string "We were running low on\n"
	.string "the fuses for the healing machine.\p"
	.string "But it showed up finally.\n"
	.string "Just three hours late.\l"
	.string "No big deal, I suppose.\p"
	.string "Your POKeMON are healed.\l"
	.string "Don't be a stranger. Ha.$"

gText_NurseRandom_13::
	.string "You again? I was just\n"
	.string "filing some paperwork.\p"
	.string "We switched to a new\n"
	.string "system where everything\l"
	.string "is sorted by date now.\p"
	.string "It used to be by name.\n"
	.string "Honestly, the old one\l"
	.string "made more sense to me.\p"
	.string "Anyway, your team is healed.\l"
	.string "Perfect! Till we meet again.$"

gText_NurseRandom_14::
	.string "Hi there. We just had the\n"
	.string "water cooler replaced.\p"
	.string "The old one made this\n"
	.string "weird gurgling noise\l"
	.string "every ten minutes or so.\p"
	.string "This new one is quiet.\n"
	.string "Almost too quiet, if\l"
	.string "you ask me about it.\p"
	.string "Anyway, all healed up.\l"
	.string "Go do your TRAINER thing.$"

gText_NurseRandom_15::
	.string "Oh, hello. I organized\n"
	.string "the back room yesterday.\p"
	.string "You would not believe the\n"
	.string "stuff I found back there.\l"
	.string "Old charts from years ago.\p"
	.string "I found expired POTIONS\n"
	.string "in a box under the shelf.\l"
	.string "How does that even happen?\p"
	.string "Your team is fully healed.\l"
	.string "Try to be more careful.$"

gText_NurseRandom_16::
	.string "Hey again. We had a safety\n"
	.string "inspection last Tuesday.\p"
	.string "They checked the machine,\n"
	.string "the fire exits, the whole\l"
	.string "building, top to bottom.\p"
	.string "We passed, thankfully.\n"
	.string "Though they did note the\l"
	.string "squeaky door. Again.\p"
	.string "POKeMON are all healed.\l"
	.string "Watch out for yourself.$"

gText_NurseRandom_17::
	.string "Oh, you. I was just going\n"
	.string "over the cleaning chart.\p"
	.string "We are supposed to mop\n"
	.string "twice a day, but honestly\l"
	.string "once is usually enough.\p"
	.string "Unless it is the rainy\n"
	.string "season. Then it is just\l"
	.string "constant muddy footprints.\p"
	.string "You are all healed up now.\l"
	.string "Wipe your feet next time.$"

gText_NurseRandom_18::
	.string "Hi. We practiced the fire\n"
	.string "drill this morning.\p"
	.string "Took us four minutes to\n"
	.string "evacuate the building.\l"
	.string "The target is under three.\p"
	.string "CHANSEY was the hold-up.\n"
	.string "She would not leave without\l"
	.string "checking on a patient.\p"
	.string "Sweet, but impractical.\l"
	.string "Your team is healed. Bye.$"

gText_NurseRandom_19::
	.string "Wew- I can't believe the thermostat is\n"
	.string "broken again, apparently.\p"
	.string "It is either too hot or\n"
	.string "too cold in here. There is\l"
	.string "no comfortable middle.\p"
	.string "Right now it is set to 69\n"
	.string "but it feels like 75.\l"
	.string "I filed a complaint.\p"
	.string "But they still haven't sent anyone out.\n"
	.string "Team is healed. Bundle up\l"
	.string "or cool down. Your call.$"

gText_NurseRandom_20::
	.string "Just can't stay away, huh?\n"
	.string "I was just thinking about lunch.\p"
	.string "But, I brought leftovers.\n"
	.string "They don't really look so great\l"
	.string "after sitting all morning.\p"
	.string "Maybe I will just get some\n"
	.string "riceballs from a shop.\l"
	.string "The ones with the seaweed.\p"
	.string "Those are pretty good.\n"
	.string "Anyway, your team is all healed up.\l"
	.string "Enjoy your afternoon.$"

gText_NurseRandom_21::
	.string "So, my bus was sooooo late\n"
	.string "this morning. Can you believe it?.\p"
	.string "For like twenty minutes\n"
	.string "I had to stand in the cold\p"
	.string "waiting there. No bench.\n"
	.string "Just standing there.\p"
	.string "You would think they would\n"
	.string "kee a tighter schedule.\l"
	.string "It is not like the route\l"
	.string "ever changes, you know?\p"
	.string "Your team is good to go by the way.$"

gText_NurseRandom_22::
	.string "Hey there. Got any big\n"
	.string "plans this weekend?\p"
	.string "I was thinking of maybe\n"
	.string "cleaning my apartment.\l"
	.string "It has gotten kind of messy.\p"
	.string "Or I could go to the park.\n"
	.string "There is supposed to be\l"
	.string "nice weather on Saturday.\p"
	.string "Decisions, decisions.\n"
	.string "Your POKeMON are healed.\l"
	.string "Have a good one!$"

gText_NurseRandom_23::
	.string "Oh, you. I bought some new work\n"
	.string "shoes last week. It was about time\p"
	.string "The old ones were falling\n"
	.string "apart at the soles. I was\l"
	.string "basically walking on an ALTARIA.\p"
	.string "These new ones have extra\n"
	.string "arch support. It really\l"
	.string "makes a difference when\l"
	.string "you stand all day long.\p"
	.string "Your team is all healed.\l"
	.string "Nice sneaks, by the way.$"

gText_NurseRandom_24::
	.string "Hi again. I have been\n"
	.string "growing berries on my window sill.\p"
	.string "The LUM is doing great\n"
	.string "but the SITRUS keeps dying.\l"
	.string "I don't know what went\l"
	.string "wrong with it at all.\p"
	.string "I gave them plenty of water?\n"
	.string "They say plants can never get enough.\l"
	.string "Maybe it wasn't getting enough sunlight?\l"
	.string "Gardening is complicated.\p"
	.string "Anyway, you are all healed.\l"
	.string "Best of luck out there.$"

gText_NurseRandom_25::
	.string "Oh hello. I am reading this book.\n"
	.string "It is about this TRAINER.\p"
	.string "And she travels all the regions\n"
	.string "winning every gym badge\l"
	.string "on her first try. Lucky.\p"
	.string "I am only on chapter four.\n"
	.string "It is pretty good so far,\l"
	.string "if a bit unrealistic.\p"
	.string "Nobody wins on first try these days.\n"
	.string "Your team is healed up.\l"
	.string "Maybe pick up a book too.$"

gText_NurseRandom_26::
	.string "Hey! So, I tried to cook a new\n"
	.string "FARFETCH'D dish last night.\p"
	.string "It was supposed to be easy.\n"
	.string "Thirty minutes, they said.\l"
	.string "It took me over an hour.\p"
	.string "And I burned it to a crisp.\n"
	.string "The smoke alarm went off,\l"
	.string "and then my neighbor knocked\l"
	.string "to check on me...\p"
	.string "I have never been so embarrassed.\n"
	.string "Your POKeMON are healed.\l"
	.string "Cooking is hard.$"

gText_NurseRandom_27::
	.string "Oh, it is you. You know my\n"
	.string "morning routine takes ages.\p"
	.string "I wake up at five in order\n"
	.string "just to get here by seven.\l"
	.string "That is two hours of prep.\p"
	.string "Shower, breakfast, walking\n"
	.string "to the bus stop, waiting,\l"
	.string "the actual ride over here.\p"
	.string "It really adds up fast.\n"
	.string "Team is healed, by the way.\l"
	.string "See you around!$"

gText_NurseRandom_28::
	.string "Hi there. I forgot to do\n"
	.string "laundry again last night.\p"
	.string "I am wearing my last clean\n"
	.string "uniform today, actually.\l"
	.string "I really need to catch up.\p"
	.string "The laundromat near me\n"
	.string "closes at nine, which is\l"
	.string "exactly when my shift\l"
	.string "ends most nights.\p"
	.string "Just perfect timing.\n"
	.string "Your POKéMON are now fully healed.\l"
	.string "Be safe out there!$"

gText_NurseRandom_29::
	.string "Oh, hey. I went to the\n"
	.string "grocery store yesterday.\p"
	.string "I just needed MOOMOO MILK and\n"
	.string "eggs. Simple stuff, right?\l"
	.string "Spent an hour in there.\p"
	.string "They rearranged all the\n"
	.string "aisles again for no reason.\l"
	.string "I could not even find everything.\p"
	.string "Even the MOOMOO MILK was moved.\n"
	.string "Your team is all healed.\l"
	.string "Shopping is the real battle.$"

gText_NurseRandom_30::
	.string "Oh, hi. My coworker just\n"
	.string "got back from vacation.\p"
	.string "She went to the SEVII ISLANDS\n"
	.string " or two weeks.\l"
	.string "Must be nice, honestly.\p"
	.string "She showed me all her\n"
	.string "photos. Two hundred of\l"
	.string "them. I counted. I smiled\l"
	.string "through every single one.\p"
	.string "I need a vacation too.\n"
	.string "You are all healed up now.\l"
	.string "Cause I need a break, I need a vacation.$"

gText_NurseRandom_31::
	.string "Hey again. We got a new\n"
	.string "hire starting next week.\p"
	.string "I am supposed to train her.\n"
	.string "That means twice the work\l"
	.string "for me, as usual.\p"
	.string "Nobody ever trained me.\n"
	.string "I just figured it out on\l"
	.string "my own, day by day.\p"
	.string "That is how it was back\n"
	.string "then. Sink or swim.\l"
	.string "Your team is all healed.\l"
	.string "Good luck to us both.$"

gText_NurseRandom_32::
	.string "You are back. We had a big\n"
	.string "staff meeting this morning.\p"
	.string "The regional manager came.\n"
	.string "He talked for like an hour\l"
	.string "about efficiency and productivity.\p"
	.string "I learned nothing new.\n"
	.string "But there were free muffins\l"
	.string "afterwards, so that was\l"
	.string "something at least.\p"
	.string "I grabbed two blueberry.\n"
	.string "Your team is healed now.\l"
	.string "Meetings are the real enemy.$"

gText_NurseRandom_33::
	.string "Oh, hi. It was someone's\n"
	.string "birthday in the office.\p"
	.string "We had cake during break.\n"
	.string "Vanilla with buttercream.\l"
	.string "Not my favorite honestly.\p"
	.string "I prefer chocolate, but\n"
	.string "it is rude to complain\l"
	.string "about free cake, right?\p"
	.string "I ate it all while no one was watching.\n"
	.string "SNORLAX would have been proud!.\l"
	.string "You are healed. Try not to\l"
	.string "come back too soon, okay?$"

gText_NurseRandom_34::
	.string "Hey. The coffee machine in\n"
	.string "the break room broke again.\p"
	.string "This is the third time\n"
	.string "this month, I swear.\l"
	.string "It just stopped brewing.\p"
	.string "We all had to use instant coffee today.\n"
	.string "Only decaf would have been worse.\l"
	.string "Like, genuinely tragic.\p"
	.string "I can not work like this.\n"
	.string "Instant coffee is not real\l"
	.string "coffee in my opinion.\l"
	.string "Team is healed. Need coffee.$"

gText_NurseRandom_35::
	.string "But it's nice not having to park.\n"
	.string "The situation is a nightmare.\p"
	.string "There are only six spots\n"
	.string "for twelve staff members.\l"
	.string "Six. For twelve people.\p"
	.string "I have to park two blocks\n"
	.string "away and walk every day.\l"
	.string "In rain, in heat, in snow.\p"
	.string "I have complained about it\n"
	.string "many times. Nothing changes.\l"
	.string "Your team is healed up.\l"
	.string "Have a good day!$"

gText_NurseRandom_36::
	.string "Hi again. They rearragnged\n"
	.string "my desk last week. For fun.\p"
	.string "It was by the window and\n"
	.string "now I can't find anything.\l"
	.string "Nothing is where I left it.\p"
	.string "I had a nice little LUM growing\n"
	.string "on the windowsill too.\l"
	.string "But they just had to move it.\l"
	.string "It is sad now. The plant, I mean.\p"
	.string "And me, a little bit.\n"
	.string "Can't believe they didn't ask me.\l"
	.string "Your team is all healed up now.$"

gText_NurseRandom_37::
	.string "Oh, hey again! I was just talking\n"
	.string "with my friend upstairs.\p"
	.string "They call him the MINT MASTER.\n"
	.string "he always has these rare mints with him.\l"
	.string "apparently they can change the NATURE\n"
	.string "of your POKeMON if he feeds them one.\p"
	.string "But the more I think about it,\n"
	.string "I have more questions then answers.\l"
	.string "What do you think they taste like?\p"
	.string "Would my personality change if I...\p"
	.string "I need to know!\p"
	.string "Oh, your team is healed now.$"
	

gText_NurseRandom_38::
	.string "Hey. Did you know we have a\n"
	.string "lost and found box behind the desk?\p"
	.string "You would not believe what\n"
	.string "people leave behind here.\l"
	.string "Hats, bags, even shoes.\p"
	.string "Who forgets their shoes?\n"
	.string "I genuinely want to know.\l"
	.string "Like, you just walk out\l"
	.string "barefoot?\p"
	.string "The human mind is a thing.\n"
	.string "Your POKeMON are healed.\l"
	.string "Don't forget your shoes.$"

gText_NurseRandom_39::
	.string "So there's this debate going on\n"
	.string "about the dress code here.\p"
	.string "Some nurses want to wear\n"
	.string "colored scrubs. Pink ones,\l"
	.string "blue ones, patterns even.\p"
	.string "Management says no. Only regular\n"
	.string "white is acceptable.\l"
	.string "Personally I would love\l"
	.string "some variety.\p"
	.string "White stains so easily.\n"
	.string "So if you see me wearing black.\l"
	.string "know that it was hard fought.\n"
	.string "Here's your POKeMON back!$"

gText_NurseRandom_40::
	.string "...\n"
	.string "Wanna know about the healing machine?\p"
	.string "It has two main settings.\n"
	.string "A powerful standard healing function\l"
	.string "and a full diagnostic mode.\p"
	.string "Most TRAINERS just need\n"
	.string "the standard heal. That is you.\l"
	.string "In and out, very simple.\p"
	.string "They both take the same amount of time.\n"
	.string "However, the rarity of POKeMON\l"
	.string "illness, we don't use the scanner much\p"
	.string "Unless we detect POKeRUS...\n"
	.string "But that like never happens!\p"
	.string "Here you go! Your team is set.$"

gText_NurseRandom_41::
	.string "Ugh, I hate dealing with our supplier\n"
	.string "it's always a nightmare.\p"
	.string "First you fill out a form.\n"
	.string "Then your supervisor signs.\l"
	.string "Then regional approves it.\p"
	.string "Then it goes to purchasing.\n"
	.string "They find a wholesaler who has\l"
	.string "what we need in stock.\p"
	.string "Then they ship it here. It\n"
	.string "usually takes two weeks at\l"
	.string "minimum. Sometimes three.\p"
	.string "And something is ALWAYS missing!\l"
	.string "Here's your party back. Bye!$"

gText_NurseRandom_42::
	.string "Jeez! Our records are a mess they have\n"
	.string "to be kept both digital and paper.\p"
	.string "I have to log every single\n"
	.string "visit in both systems.\l"
	.string "Yes, both. Every single time.\p"
	.string "The digital system crashes like\n"
	.string "at least once a day, because\l"
	.string "the database is held together with\n"
	.string "STRING SHOT and tape.\p"
	.string "Which is why they keep demanding.\n"
	.string "the paper backups.\p"
	.string "Yours is getting quite\n"
	.string "thick, by the way...\l"
	.string "The paper file, I mean.\p"
	.string "You are healed. As usual.\l"
	.string "Guess I'll add this to the stack.$"

gText_NurseRandom_43::
	.string "You know, caring for my\n"
	.string "CHANSEY is a job in itself.\p"
	.string "She needs special food\n"
	.string "prepared fresh every day.\l"
	.string "No leftovers. She knows.\p"
	.string "I also brush her egg pouch\n"
	.string "twice a week. Yes, her egg\l"
	.string "pouch. Dusty apparently.\p"
	.string "And she likes bedtime\n"
	.string "stories. I am not joking.\l"
	.string "She will not sleep without.\p"
	.string "High maintenance POKeMON.\l"
	.string "Healed. Don't neglect your POKeMON.$"

gText_NurseRandom_44::
	.string "You know, I used to be in awe\n"
	.string "of the information that the internet\p"
	.string "has put at our finger tips.\p"
	.string "But after I had to deal with one\n"
	.string "patient who was a WebNJ expert,\p"
	.string "now I'm not so sure.\p"
	.string "They were flipping out because they just\n"
	.string "knew one of their POKeMON had POKeRUS.\p"
	.string "It's actually beneficial to EV growth...\n"
	.string "But try telling them that!\p"
	.string "Anyway, sorry to ramble.\n"
	.string "Your POKeMON were healed to perfection.$"

gText_NurseRandom_45::
	.string "Welcome back. Did you know\n"
	.string "about our intake process?\p"
	.string "When you hand me your team,\n"
	.string "I scan each BALL for ID.\l"
	.string "Then I confirm your name.\p"
	.string "Then the machine checks for\n"
	.string "status conditions first.\l"
	.string "Then it heals HP fully.\p"
	.string "Then PP is restored for\n"
	.string "every move on every member.\l"
	.string "The whole thing takes about\l"
	.string "thirty seconds flat.\p"
	.string "Your team is done. As usual.$"

gText_NurseRandom_46::
	.string "Hey. The storage room here\n"
	.string "is a complete disaster.\p"
	.string "We have boxes from five\n"
	.string "years ago still in there.\p"
	.string "Nobody knows the contents,\n"
	.string "and nothing is labled.\p"
	.string "I opened one last week,\n"
	.string "and it was full of old holiday\l"
	.string "decorations from who knows when.\p"
	.string "Dustiest room you've ever seen.\n"
	.string "There were also expired\p"
	.string "pamphlets about various medicine.\n"
	.string "They didn't even mention AP or IP.\p"
	.string "Healing complete!$"

gText_NurseRandom_47::
	.string "Hello, again. Come to listen\n"
	.string "to the woes of a nurse?\p"
	.string "Yesterday I had a patient\n"
	.string "who attempted to treat their\l"
	.string "fainted POKeMON with MINT BERRY syrup.\n"
	.string "Thanfully I was able to revieve them,\p"
	.string "however, the POKeMON weren't too happy\n"
	.string "about smelling strongly of mint.\p"
	.string "BUG type POKeMON don't care for it.\n"
	.string "But I guess WebNJ didn't mention that.\p"
	.string "Oops! I've taken up too much time.\n"
	.string "Thanks for listening to my story!\p"
	.string "Your POKeMON are now healed fully.$"

gText_NurseRandom_48::
	.string "Bet you didn't know the healing machine\n"
	.string "needs to be recalibrated every month?\p"
	.string "It's this whole process, and since\n"
	.string "the machines are old, they make\l"
	.string "concerning noises.\p"
	.string "I really wish corporate would\n"
	.string "just replace them already.\l"
	.string "Some of them even smoke when booting up.\p"
	.string "I'm pretty sure that's a fire hazard.\n"
	.string "Guess it's only a matter of time before\l"
	.string "we get our own BURNED TOWER.\p"
	.string "But your Pokemon are healed.\n"
	.string "to perfect health!$"

gText_NurseRandom_49::
	.string "Have you ever felt like you were\n"
	.string "just having one of those days?\p"
	.string "Earlier I was taking someone's POKeMON\n"
	.string "out of the healing machine, when\l"
	.string "all of the sudden tragedy struck.\n"
	.string "I accidentally dropped a POKEBALL and\p"
	.string "it kinda just rolled under the counter.\n"
	.string "It would have been easier to make it\p"
	.string "through DARK CAVE, than trying to\n"
	.string "recover that ball.\p"
	.string "Do you think they'll notice the ball\n"
	.string "I replaced it with is empty?\p"
	.string "I really hope not...$"

gText_NurseRandom_50::
	.string "I've really gone and done it this time.\p"
	.string "You know how they say that babies\n"
	.string "at the hospital get switched\p"
	.string "like all the time?\p"
	.string "We'll I kinda did that with one\n"
	.string "of somebody's POKeMON...\p"
	.string "It was a freak accident! Okay?\n"
	.string "The trays got bumbed and the POKEBALLS\l"
	.string "must have gotten swapped or something.\n"
	.string "Think the trainers are gonna notice?\p"
	.string "I'm sure it happens all the time\n"
	.string "with POKeMON too, right?\p"
	.string "Right???$"

gText_NurseRandom_51::
	.string "Hey there. You know, I see\n"
	.string "a lot of regulars here.\p"
	.string "There is a girl who comes\n"
	.string "in every morning at eight.\l"
	.string "Always polite. Always tips\l"
	.string "her hat on the way out.\p"
	.string "Then there is a boy who\n"
	.string "only visits on Tuesdays.\l"
	.string "Weird schedule, but okay.\p"
	.string "And then there is you, who\n"
	.string "visits... constantly.\l"
	.string "No schedule. Just chaos.\p"
	.string "You are in your own class.\l"
	.string "Healed. Bye now.$"

gText_NurseRandom_52::
	.string "Oh, hi. I have healed many\n"
	.string "different POKeMON here.\p"
	.string "Big ones, small ones, mean\n"
	.string "ones, gentle ones. All sorts.\l"
	.string "Every single one is unique.\p"
	.string "The hardest to handle are\n"
	.string "ELECTRODE. They are giant\l"
	.string "spheres that could blow up\l"
	.string "at any moment.\p"
	.string "The cutest are SKITTY.\n"
	.string "They purr on the machine.\l"
	.string "Your team is... somewhere\l"
	.string "in the middle of the scale.\p"
	.string "Healed. Take care of them.$"

gText_NurseRandom_53::
	.string "You know, this building is\n"
	.string "actually quite old.\p"
	.string "It was built about twenty\n"
	.string "years ago. The roof leaks\l"
	.string "when it rains really hard.\p"
	.string "They keep patching it up\n"
	.string "instead of replacing it.\l"
	.string "Budget cuts, they say.\p"
	.string "The waiting room chairs\n"
	.string "are original too. You can\l"
	.string "tell by how uncomfortable\l"
	.string "they are to sit on.\p"
	.string "Delightfully vintage.\l"
	.string "Healed. Enjoy those chairs.$"

gText_NurseRandom_54::
	.string "Hello. Did you know that\n"
	.string "different regions have\l"
	.string "different CENTER designs?\p"
	.string "In KANTO they are more\n"
	.string "traditional. Red roofs\l"
	.string "and small lobbies.\p"
	.string "In SINNOH they are very\n"
	.string "modern and sleek looking.\l"
	.string "Much nicer than ours.\p"
	.string "Ours is kind of plain.\n"
	.string "Functional, sure. But\l"
	.string "nothing to really brag\l"
	.string "about, you know?\p"
	.string "Healed. Try another CENTER.$"

gText_NurseRandom_55::
	.string "Hey. Summer is the busiest\n"
	.string "season for us, actually.\p"
	.string "More TRAINERS on the road\n"
	.string "means more injuries means\l"
	.string "more visits. Like yours.\p"
	.string "Winter is the slow time.\n"
	.string "Barely anyone comes in.\l"
	.string "I just sit and read mostly.\p"
	.string "Spring is nice. Moderate\n"
	.string "traffic. Good weather too.\l"
	.string "Fall is unpredictable.\p"
	.string "Kind of like your visits.\n"
	.string "No pattern whatsoever.\l"
	.string "Healed. See you in a bit.$"

gText_NurseRandom_56::
	.string "Have you ever listened to\n"
	.string "the healing machine closely?\p"
	.string "It makes this soft hum when\n"
	.string "it is working. Quite nice.\l"
	.string "I have grown fond of it.\p"
	.string "Sometimes when it is quiet\n"
	.string "and nobody is here, I just\l"
	.string "listen to it. Peaceful.\p"
	.string "Then someone walks in and\n"
	.string "ruins the moment. Often\l"
	.string "it is you who walks in.\p"
	.string "Not blaming you. Just\n"
	.string "noting the pattern here.\l"
	.string "Healed. Enjoy the hum.$"

gText_NurseRandom_57::
	.string "Hi. My evening routine is\n"
	.string "basically the opposite of\l"
	.string "my morning one.\p"
	.string "I lock up, count supplies,\n"
	.string "write the handoff notes,\l"
	.string "clean the machine surface.\p"
	.string "Then I walk to the bus\n"
	.string "stop. Wait. Ride home.\l"
	.string "Microwave something sad.\p"
	.string "Watch a show. Fall asleep.\n"
	.string "Wake up. Do it all again.\l"
	.string "It is a simple life.\p"
	.string "Healed. You disrupted my\l"
	.string "supply count. Thanks.$"

gText_NurseRandom_58::
	.string "You know, I think about\n"
	.string "the role of CENTERS a lot.\p"
	.string "We are the backbone of the\n"
	.string "TRAINER system, really.\l"
	.string "Without us, nobody travels.\p"
	.string "But do we get recognition?\n"
	.string "Awards? Appreciation days?\l"
	.string "Not really, no.\p"
	.string "TRAINERS rush in, get\n"
	.string "healed, rush out. No chat.\l"
	.string "No 'how are you doing?'\l"
	.string "Just gimme gimme gimme.\p"
	.string "You are one of the chatty\l"
	.string "ones though. Healed. Go.$"

gText_NurseRandom_59::
	.string "Hello. My CHANSEY and I\n"
	.string "have been partners for\l"
	.string "eight years now.\p"
	.string "She was just a HAPPINY\n"
	.string "when we first met. Tiny\l"
	.string "little thing. So eager.\p"
	.string "Now she runs half the\n"
	.string "CENTER by herself. I am\l"
	.string "basically her assistant.\p"
	.string "She does the heavy lifting.\n"
	.string "I do the paperwork mostly.\l"
	.string "It is a good partnership.\p"
	.string "Speaking of her, she says\l"
	.string "your team is healed. Bye.$"

gText_NurseRandom_60::
	.string "Oh, you. Let me tell you\n"
	.string "about my first day here.\p"
	.string "I was so nervous I nearly\n"
	.string "dropped the first POKe BALL\l"
	.string "a TRAINER handed me.\p"
	.string "It was a GEODUDE inside.\n"
	.string "The BALL hit the floor and\l"
	.string "the GEODUDE popped right\l"
	.string "out. Just sat there. Stared.\p"
	.string "The TRAINER laughed. My\n"
	.string "supervisor did not laugh.\l"
	.string "I thought I would be fired.\p"
	.string "But here I am, years later.\n"
	.string "Still dropping stuff.\l"
	.string "Healed. Don't tell anyone.$"

gText_NurseRandom_61::
	.string "Hi there. The weirdest\n"
	.string "patient I ever had was\l"
	.string "definitely this DITTO.\p"
	.string "It kept transforming into\n"
	.string "the healing machine. Like,\l"
	.string "the actual machine.\p"
	.string "Every time I tried to scan\n"
	.string "it, it became the scanner.\l"
	.string "Very confusing experience.\p"
	.string "I eventually tricked it by\n"
	.string "offering it a BERRY, and\l"
	.string "it transformed into that.\p"
	.string "Then I could scan it fine.\n"
	.string "Clever workaround, right?\l"
	.string "Healed. Watch your DITTOS.$"

gText_NurseRandom_62::
	.string "You know, we had a power\n"
	.string "outage here once. Total\l"
	.string "blackout. Very alarming.\p"
	.string "The machine shut down mid\n"
	.string "heal. Three POKe BALLS\l"
	.string "stuck inside it.\p"
	.string "The TRAINER was panicking.\n"
	.string "I was panicking. CHANSEY\l"
	.string "was the only calm one.\p"
	.string "Power came back after ten\n"
	.string "minutes. Felt like hours.\l"
	.string "The POKeMON were fine.\p"
	.string "But now I keep a flashlight\n"
	.string "in every drawer. Just in\l"
	.string "case. Healed. Bye now.$"

gText_NurseRandom_63::
	.string "Hey. A famous TRAINER came\n"
	.string "through here once. Won't\l"
	.string "say who. Privacy policy.\p"
	.string "But they had this amazing\n"
	.string "team. All fully evolved.\l"
	.string "Shiny coats. Perfect form.\p"
	.string "I healed them even though\n"
	.string "they barely needed it.\l"
	.string "Just a routine checkup.\p"
	.string "That TRAINER said thanks\n"
	.string "and walked out. So polite.\l"
	.string "That is what good TRAINERS\l"
	.string "do. They say thanks.\p"
	.string "You also say thanks, so\l"
	.string "that is nice. Healed. Go.$"

gText_NurseRandom_64::
	.string "Oh, hello. The machine\n"
	.string "broke down last month.\p"
	.string "Like, completely stopped.\n"
	.string "No lights, no hum, nothing.\l"
	.string "Dead as a doorknob.\p"
	.string "The repair tech came four\n"
	.string "hours later. FOUR hours.\l"
	.string "I had to turn people away.\p"
	.string "Do you know how hard it is\n"
	.string "to tell a TRAINER with six\l"
	.string "fainted POKeMON to just\l"
	.string "wait? It is heartbreaking.\p"
	.string "It was just a fuse, too.\n"
	.string "A simple fuse. Four hours.\l"
	.string "Healed. Value this machine.$"

gText_NurseRandom_65::
	.string "Hi. This one time, during\n"
	.string "the holiday season, we\l"
	.string "decorated the whole CENTER.\p"
	.string "Lights, garlands, the works.\n"
	.string "Even put a hat on CHANSEY.\l"
	.string "She loved it, honestly.\p"
	.string "But then a TRAINER's\n"
	.string "ELECTRIKE shocked all the\l"
	.string "lights and blew a fuse.\p"
	.string "Half the decorations went\n"
	.string "dark. The other half caught\l"
	.string "fire a little bit. Just a\l"
	.string "little bit of fire.\p"
	.string "We don't decorate anymore.\l"
	.string "Healed. Happy holidays.$"

gText_NurseRandom_66::
	.string "Oh, you. Regional office\n"
	.string "sent a surprise inspector.\p"
	.string "He checked everything. The\n"
	.string "machine, the floors, my\l"
	.string "smile, the waiting chairs.\p"
	.string "He wrote notes on a little\n"
	.string "clipboard. Very intense.\l"
	.string "Did not say a single word.\p"
	.string "Just nodded and scribbled.\n"
	.string "I still don't know if we\l"
	.string "passed or failed the test.\p"
	.string "That was three weeks ago.\n"
	.string "No word. Just silence.\l"
	.string "Very stressful honestly.\l"
	.string "Healed. Inspect yourself.$"

gText_NurseRandom_67::
	.string "Hey. So one time a TRAINER\n"
	.string "left a POKe BALL here. Just\l"
	.string "left it on the counter.\p"
	.string "I did not know whose it was.\n"
	.string "Nobody came back for it.\l"
	.string "For three whole days.\p"
	.string "I could not open it without\n"
	.string "authorization, so it just\l"
	.string "sat there, being mysterious.\p"
	.string "The TRAINER finally showed\n"
	.string "up. Turns out it was empty.\l"
	.string "They just forgot an empty\l"
	.string "BALL. That's the story.\p"
	.string "Anticlimactic, I know.\l"
	.string "Healed. Don't leave stuff.$"

gText_NurseRandom_68::
	.string "Hi. They renovated the\n"
	.string "bathroom here last year.\p"
	.string "It took three months.\n"
	.string "THREE months for one small\l"
	.string "bathroom. Unbelievable.\p"
	.string "During that time, I had\n"
	.string "to use the one in the shop\l"
	.string "next door. The clerk gave\l"
	.string "me looks about it.\p"
	.string "Not officially rude. But\n"
	.string "she had this expression\l"
	.string "unless I bought something.\p"
	.string "I now own forty packs of\n"
	.string "gum I did not want at all.\l"
	.string "Healed. Bathroom works now.$"

gText_NurseRandom_69::
	.string "Oh hi. We hosted a free\n"
	.string "health screening once.\p"
	.string "It was supposed to be a\n"
	.string "nice community outreach\l"
	.string "thing. Come in, get your\l"
	.string "POKeMON checked. Simple.\p"
	.string "Eighty people showed up.\n"
	.string "Eighty. We expected maybe\l"
	.string "fifteen. The line wrapped\l"
	.string "around the building twice.\p"
	.string "CHANSEY nearly collapsed.\n"
	.string "I worked fourteen hours.\l"
	.string "Never again, honestly.\p"
	.string "Free events are a trap.\l"
	.string "Healed. No free screenings.$"

gText_NurseRandom_70::
	.string "Hello. I had a dream about\n"
	.string "work last night. Never a\l"
	.string "good sign.\p"
	.string "In the dream, the healing\n"
	.string "machine could talk. It kept\l"
	.string "saying 'I am tired too.'\p"
	.string "Then it walked away. Just\n"
	.string "grew legs and walked right\l"
	.string "out the front door.\p"
	.string "I chased it through town\n"
	.string "in my pajamas yelling at\l"
	.string "it to come back please.\p"
	.string "CHANSEY was there too.\n"
	.string "She was riding it like\l"
	.string "a horse. Very surreal.\l"
	.string "Healed. Dreams are weird.$"

gText_NurseRandom_71::
	.string "You again. I always wanted\n"
	.string "to be a nurse, you know.\p"
	.string "When I was little, I healed\n"
	.string "stuffed animals with band\l"
	.string "aids. Very professional.\p"
	.string "My mom thought I would grow\n"
	.string "out of it. I did not.\l"
	.string "Went to nursing school.\p"
	.string "Four years of studying\n"
	.string "POKeMON biology, machine\l"
	.string "operation, bedside manner.\p"
	.string "Graduated middle of class.\n"
	.string "Not the best, not worst.\l"
	.string "Perfectly average, really.\p"
	.string "And here I am, healing you.\l"
	.string "Again. Healed. Go on.$"

gText_NurseRandom_72::
	.string "Oh, hi. My sister had her\n"
	.string "wedding last month. A big\l"
	.string "event. Very fancy.\p"
	.string "I was a bridesmaid. I had\n"
	.string "to wear this puffy dress.\l"
	.string "Light purple. Not my shade.\p"
	.string "The ceremony was outdoors\n"
	.string "and it started drizzling.\l"
	.string "Everyone's hair went flat.\p"
	.string "The cake was nice though.\n"
	.string "Three tiers. Vanilla and\l"
	.string "strawberry combination.\p"
	.string "I caught the bouquet.\n"
	.string "Everyone cheered at that.\l"
	.string "I don't know why honestly.\l"
	.string "Healed. Wedding was fine.$"

gText_NurseRandom_73::
	.string "Hey. CHANSEY has quite the\n"
	.string "personality. Let me say.\p"
	.string "She insists on organizing\n"
	.string "the POKe BALLS by color\l"
	.string "before putting them in.\p"
	.string "Red ones here, blue there.\n"
	.string "She gets upset if I mix\l"
	.string "them. Genuinely upset.\p"
	.string "She also hums while she\n"
	.string "works. The same tune every\l"
	.string "single day. I don't know\l"
	.string "what song it is.\p"
	.string "I have asked. She smiles.\n"
	.string "And keeps humming. Forever.\l"
	.string "It is in my head now too.\l"
	.string "Healed. Good luck out there.$"

gText_NurseRandom_74::
	.string "Oh, you again. I went to a\n"
	.string "regional nursing conference.\p"
	.string "It was in LILYCOVE CITY.\n"
	.string "Very nice hotel. Free food.\l"
	.string "That part was excellent.\p"
	.string "The presentations were\n"
	.string "extremely boring though.\l"
	.string "New healing techniques.\l"
	.string "Machine firmware updates.\p"
	.string "I fell asleep in one of\n"
	.string "them. Not even a good nap.\l"
	.string "Those hotel chairs are bad.\p"
	.string "I did get a free pen and\n"
	.string "a tote bag with a logo.\l"
	.string "So that was the highlight.\l"
	.string "Healed. I need a real nap.$"

gText_NurseRandom_75::
	.string "Hi. This CENTER has been\n"
	.string "around for twenty years.\p"
	.string "The original one was much\n"
	.string "smaller. Just one room\l"
	.string "and a basic machine.\p"
	.string "They expanded it ten years\n"
	.string "ago. Added the lobby and\l"
	.string "the second floor.\p"
	.string "The walls still have the\n"
	.string "original paint underneath.\l"
	.string "Three layers of paint now.\p"
	.string "Sometimes I wonder what\n"
	.string "stories these walls hold.\l"
	.string "All the TRAINERS who have\l"
	.string "passed through over time.\p"
	.string "Then you walk in. Healed.$"

gText_NurseRandom_76::
	.string "You know, my favorite\n"
	.string "memory from this job is\l"
	.string "actually really simple.\p"
	.string "A little kid came in with\n"
	.string "her first POKeMON ever.\l"
	.string "A tiny injured ZIGZAGOON.\p"
	.string "She was crying because she\n"
	.string "thought it would not make\l"
	.string "it. Real tears. Shaking.\p"
	.string "I healed it in seconds.\n"
	.string "When it came back healthy,\l"
	.string "her face just lit up.\p"
	.string "She hugged the ZIGZAGOON.\n"
	.string "Then she hugged me. And\l"
	.string "then she hugged CHANSEY.\l"
	.string "That is why I do this. Healed.$"

gText_NurseRandom_77::
	.string "Oh hey. I have been thinking\n"
	.string "about retirement lately.\p"
	.string "Not for years, but still.\n"
	.string "I wonder what I would do\l"
	.string "with all that free time.\p"
	.string "Maybe I would travel. See\n"
	.string "every CENTER I have only\l"
	.string "read about. Tourist style.\p"
	.string "Or maybe I would open a\n"
	.string "small cafe. Somewhere nice.\l"
	.string "No machines. No injuries.\p"
	.string "Just coffee and pastries.\n"
	.string "CHANSEY could be a waiter.\l"
	.string "She would be great at that.\p"
	.string "But that is years away.\l"
	.string "For now, you are healed. Go.$"

gText_NurseRandom_78::
	.string "Hello. Night shifts are\n"
	.string "something else entirely.\p"
	.string "The CENTER is mostly empty\n"
	.string "after midnight. Just me,\l"
	.string "the hum of the machine.\p"
	.string "Sometimes a TRAINER walks\n"
	.string "in at like 2 AM. Looking\l"
	.string "rough. Barely awake.\p"
	.string "I heal their team in\n"
	.string "silence. They nod. Leave.\l"
	.string "Very minimal interaction.\p"
	.string "Once, someone fell asleep\n"
	.string "in the waiting chairs. I\l"
	.string "let them stay till morning.\p"
	.string "Don't tell my supervisor.\l"
	.string "Healed. Get some sleep.$"

gText_NurseRandom_79::
	.string "Hey. It is my ten year work\n"
	.string "anniversary this month.\p"
	.string "Ten years at the same desk.\n"
	.string "Same machine. Same CHANSEY.\l"
	.string "Same everything, basically.\p"
	.string "I have healed over fifty\n"
	.string "thousand POKeMON in that\l"
	.string "time. Give or take a few.\p"
	.string "Some of those were yours.\n"
	.string "A concerning number of\l"
	.string "them were yours, actually.\p"
	.string "But I am not complaining.\n"
	.string "Every heal counts toward\l"
	.string "my career total.\p"
	.string "You are boosting my stats.\l"
	.string "Healed. Here is to ten more.$"

gText_NurseRandom_80::
	.string "Oh, you. I have been\n"
	.string "thinking about healing.\p"
	.string "Not just the machine part,\n"
	.string "but the bigger picture.\l"
	.string "What does it mean to heal?\p"
	.string "Is it just fixing HP? Or\n"
	.string "is it restoring something\l"
	.string "deeper? Like trust. Hope.\p"
	.string "When your POKeMON faint,\n"
	.string "they lose confidence maybe.\l"
	.string "The machine fixes bodies\l"
	.string "but not their minds.\p"
	.string "Do they worry about going\n"
	.string "back out? Do they wonder\l"
	.string "if they will faint again?\p"
	.string "These keep me up at night.\n"
	.string "I think too much probably.\l"
	.string "Healed. Think about that.$"

gText_NurseRandom_81::
	.string "Hi. I reflect on each day\n"
	.string "during my bus ride home.\p"
	.string "I think about the POKeMON\n"
	.string "I healed. Their injuries.\l"
	.string "The TRAINERS who brought\l"
	.string "them to my counter.\p"
	.string "Some days are eventful.\n"
	.string "Burns, poison, confusion.\l"
	.string "Emergency situations.\p"
	.string "Other days, it is just\n"
	.string "routine after routine.\l"
	.string "Heal, bow, next person.\p"
	.string "Today has been the second\n"
	.string "kind. Routine. Predictable.\l"
	.string "Your visits are very much\l"
	.string "part of that routine now.\p"
	.string "It is oddly grounding.\l"
	.string "Healed. See you tomorrow.$"

gText_NurseRandom_82::
	.string "You again. Did you know\n"
	.string "how CENTERS are funded?\p"
	.string "It is all government money.\n"
	.string "That is why healing is free.\l"
	.string "Taxpayer funded, basically.\p"
	.string "The budget covers my pay,\n"
	.string "supplies, machine upkeep,\l"
	.string "and the building itself.\p"
	.string "It is actually not very\n"
	.string "much money, honestly.\l"
	.string "We make do with what we\l"
	.string "get. Cut corners sometimes.\p"
	.string "The waiting chairs? Budget.\n"
	.string "The old magazines? Budget.\l"
	.string "My mediocre coffee? Budget.\p"
	.string "But healing is always free.\n"
	.string "That is the one rule.\l"
	.string "Healed. Thank your taxes.$"

gText_NurseRandom_83::
	.string "Oh, hi. Training CHANSEY\n"
	.string "was harder than you think.\p"
	.string "When she first arrived, she\n"
	.string "was overly enthusiastic.\l"
	.string "Knocking things over a lot.\p"
	.string "She tried to hug every\n"
	.string "single TRAINER who walked\l"
	.string "through the door. Cute but\l"
	.string "kind of a liability.\p"
	.string "I had to teach her proper\n"
	.string "workplace boundaries first.\l"
	.string "No hugging patients please.\p"
	.string "She learned eventually.\n"
	.string "Now she is very professional.\l"
	.string "Mostly. She still sneaks\l"
	.string "hugs when I am not looking.\p"
	.string "I pretend not to notice.\l"
	.string "Healed. She says goodbye.$"

gText_NurseRandom_84::
	.string "Hey. I have opinions about\n"
	.string "POKeMON healthcare policy.\p"
	.string "For one, there should be\n"
	.string "more CENTERS. Way more.\l"
	.string "Some routes have none.\p"
	.string "TRAINERS walk for hours\n"
	.string "with injured partners\l"
	.string "just to reach us here.\p"
	.string "Second, the machines need\n"
	.string "upgrading. Ours is a model\l"
	.string "from eight years ago.\p"
	.string "Third, nurses need better\n"
	.string "pay. We work long hours.\l"
	.string "Holidays, weekends, nights.\p"
	.string "Nobody listens to us.\n"
	.string "We just smile and heal.\l"
	.string "That is the expectation.\l"
	.string "Healed. I will keep smiling.$"

gText_NurseRandom_85::
	.string "Oh, you. Being a nurse is\n"
	.string "kind of a thankless gig.\p"
	.string "You help people all day.\n"
	.string "You smile at every face.\l"
	.string "You fix what is broken.\p"
	.string "And at the end of the day,\n"
	.string "you go home to leftovers\l"
	.string "and a quiet apartment.\p"
	.string "Nobody asks how your day\n"
	.string "was. Nobody checks if\l"
	.string "you are doing okay.\p"
	.string "I love this job. I really\n"
	.string "do. But some days it feels\l"
	.string "like shouting into a void.\p"
	.string "Then someone like you\n"
	.string "walks in, and I heal, and\l"
	.string "there is purpose in that.\l"
	.string "Healed. I am fine, thanks.$"

gText_NurseRandom_86::
	.string "Hello. The CENTER serves\n"
	.string "a role in the community.\p"
	.string "We are not just a hospital.\n"
	.string "We are a landmark. A beacon.\l"
	.string "That red roof means safety.\p"
	.string "People give directions\n"
	.string "using us. Turn left at the\l"
	.string "CENTER. You know the block.\p"
	.string "Kids use our lobby when\n"
	.string "it rains. Nowhere else\l"
	.string "to go. I let them stay.\p"
	.string "Elderly folk come just to\n"
	.string "sit. Don't even have teams.\l"
	.string "They just like the company.\p"
	.string "This place is more than\n"
	.string "a healing station to us.\l"
	.string "It is a home of sorts.\l"
	.string "Healed. You are part of it.$"

gText_NurseRandom_87::
	.string "Hey. I wonder what POKeMON\n"
	.string "healing will look like in\l"
	.string "fifty years from now.\p"
	.string "Maybe the machines will be\n"
	.string "instant. Zero wait time.\l"
	.string "Just tap and you are done.\p"
	.string "Maybe there will not be\n"
	.string "nurses at all. Just robots.\l"
	.string "Automated and efficient.\p"
	.string "That thought scares me a\n"
	.string "bit. Not the robots part.\l"
	.string "The not being needed part.\p"
	.string "What would I do then?\n"
	.string "Open that cafe, I guess.\l"
	.string "CHANSEY and me. Pastries.\p"
	.string "Until then, I am here.\n"
	.string "Healing POKeMON like yours.\l"
	.string "Healed. The future can wait.$"

gText_NurseRandom_88::
	.string "You. Let us talk about work\n"
	.string "and life balance for a sec.\p"
	.string "I work five days a week.\n"
	.string "Sometimes six. Ten hours\l"
	.string "each day, give or take.\p"
	.string "That leaves me with maybe\n"
	.string "four waking hours at home.\l"
	.string "Subtract cooking and chores.\p"
	.string "I get about two hours of\n"
	.string "actual free time per day.\l"
	.string "Two hours. That is nothing.\p"
	.string "I watch one show. Maybe\n"
	.string "read ten pages of a book.\l"
	.string "Then it is sleep time.\p"
	.string "On weekends I do laundry\n"
	.string "and groceries. Exciting.\l"
	.string "Where does the time go?\l"
	.string "Healed. Enjoy your freedom.$"

gText_NurseRandom_89::
	.string "Oh, hello. There is a tree\n"
	.string "outside that I watch daily.\p"
	.string "In spring it gets blossoms.\n"
	.string "Pink ones. Very pretty.\l"
	.string "They fall like confetti.\p"
	.string "In summer it is full green.\n"
	.string "Lush and shady. TAILLOW\l"
	.string "nest in the branches.\p"
	.string "Autumn turns it gold and\n"
	.string "red. Leaves pile up around\l"
	.string "the entrance every day.\p"
	.string "Winter strips it bare.\n"
	.string "Just branches against sky.\l"
	.string "Kind of beautiful honestly.\p"
	.string "I have watched that tree for\n"
	.string "ten years of seasons now.\l"
	.string "It never gets old somehow.\l"
	.string "Healed. Go look at the tree.$"

gText_NurseRandom_90::
	.string "Welcome back. Let me tell\n"
	.string "you about my morning today.\p"
	.string "I woke up at five as usual.\n"
	.string "Alarm went off. Hit snooze\l"
	.string "once. Okay, twice.\p"
	.string "Got up. Made toast. The\n"
	.string "butter was almost empty.\l"
	.string "Scraped the last of it.\p"
	.string "Brushed my teeth. Could not\n"
	.string "find my good toothbrush.\l"
	.string "Used the spare. It is stiff.\p"
	.string "Walked to the bus stop.\n"
	.string "The bus was on time today.\l"
	.string "That was the highlight.\p"
	.string "Got to the CENTER. Opened\n"
	.string "up. Turned on the machine.\l"
	.string "Made bad instant coffee.\p"
	.string "Then you walked in. And\n"
	.string "here we are. Full circle.\l"
	.string "Healed. What a morning, huh?$"

gText_NurseRandom_91::
	.string "Oh, you. Let me describe a\n"
	.string "full day at this CENTER.\p"
	.string "Seven AM: open the doors.\n"
	.string "Boot the machine up first.\l"
	.string "It takes three minutes.\p"
	.string "Seven thirty: first patient.\n"
	.string "Usually an early bird.\l"
	.string "Heal, bow, next please.\p"
	.string "Ten AM: morning rush comes.\n"
	.string "Back to back TRAINERS for\l"
	.string "about two hours straight.\p"
	.string "Noon: lunch break. Fifteen\n"
	.string "minutes. I eat at my desk.\l"
	.string "CHANSEY judges my food.\p"
	.string "Two PM: afternoon slump.\n"
	.string "Very quiet. I reorganize.\l"
	.string "Five PM: evening rush.\p"
	.string "Seven: things slow down.\n"
	.string "Nine: shift ends. Finally.\l"
	.string "Healed. You know the drill.$"

gText_NurseRandom_92::
	.string "Hey. I have been at this\n"
	.string "job for a decade. A decade.\p"
	.string "In that time I have healed\n"
	.string "thousands of POKeMON from\l"
	.string "every imaginable condition.\p"
	.string "Burns from FIRE types.\n"
	.string "Frostbite from ICE moves.\l"
	.string "Confusion. Paralysis. Sleep.\p"
	.string "I have seen TRAINERS cry.\n"
	.string "I have seen them celebrate.\l"
	.string "I have seen it all, I think.\p"
	.string "The machine changed twice.\n"
	.string "CHANSEY evolved once.\l"
	.string "I got three pay raises.\p"
	.string "I have had two supervisors.\n"
	.string "Four coworkers transferred.\l"
	.string "The coffee got worse.\p"
	.string "But I am still here. Healing.\n"
	.string "I will probably always be.\l"
	.string "Healed. Here is to ten more.$"

gText_NurseRandom_93::
	.string "Hello. The healing machine\n"
	.string "has an interesting history.\p"
	.string "The first ones were built\n"
	.string "maybe forty years ago.\l"
	.string "Very crude. Took an hour.\p"
	.string "Second gen cut it to thirty\n"
	.string "minutes. Still not great.\l"
	.string "TRAINERS would wait around.\p"
	.string "Third gen was the big leap.\n"
	.string "Five minutes per team heal.\l"
	.string "That is when CENTERS boomed.\p"
	.string "Now we are on generation\n"
	.string "seven. Thirty seconds flat.\l"
	.string "It is basically magic.\p"
	.string "The core tech uses special\n"
	.string "wavelengths that stimulate\l"
	.string "natural POKeMON recovery.\p"
	.string "I don't fully understand\n"
	.string "the science. I just press go.\l"
	.string "Healed. Appreciate the tech.$"

gText_NurseRandom_94::
	.string "You. I have been pondering\n"
	.string "something quite deep.\p"
	.string "When a POKeMON faints in\n"
	.string "battle, what do they feel?\l"
	.string "Is it like falling asleep?\p"
	.string "Do they dream while out? Do\n"
	.string "they feel the BALL carrying\l"
	.string "them back here?\p"
	.string "When the machine heals them,\n"
	.string "is it sudden? Like waking up.\l"
	.string "Or gradual? Like dawn.\p"
	.string "Do they remember losing?\n"
	.string "Does it bother them at all?\l"
	.string "Or do they just move on?\p"
	.string "I asked CHANSEY once. She\n"
	.string "just tilted her head at me.\l"
	.string "Not helpful, honestly.\p"
	.string "These are nurse thoughts.\n"
	.string "Late shift nurse thoughts.\l"
	.string "Healed. Treat them gently.$"

gText_NurseRandom_95::
	.string "Oh, hi. Different towns\n"
	.string "have different traditions.\p"
	.string "In some places, TRAINERS\n"
	.string "bring gifts to the nurse.\l"
	.string "Small things. A BERRY. Tea.\p"
	.string "In other places, it is rude\n"
	.string "to make small talk during\l"
	.string "healing. Just silence.\p"
	.string "Here the tradition seems\n"
	.string "to be general indifference.\l"
	.string "People walk in, get healed,\l"
	.string "walk out. Nothing extra.\p"
	.string "Nobody brings me BERRIES.\n"
	.string "Nobody bows. Nobody waves.\l"
	.string "You at least say hello.\p"
	.string "Which puts you above most\n"
	.string "of my patients, honestly.\l"
	.string "The bar is very low here.\p"
	.string "But I appreciate it.\l"
	.string "Healed. Maybe bring a BERRY?$"

gText_NurseRandom_96::
	.string "Hello. Let me recite some\n"
	.string "of the staff handbook.\p"
	.string "Section one: greet every\n"
	.string "visitor with a warm smile.\l"
	.string "Done. I smile constantly.\p"
	.string "Section two: heal POKeMON\n"
	.string "promptly and efficiently.\l"
	.string "Also done. I am very prompt.\p"
	.string "Section three: maintain a\n"
	.string "clean and orderly workspace.\l"
	.string "This counter is spotless.\p"
	.string "Section four: do not form\n"
	.string "personal attachments to\l"
	.string "regular patients.\p"
	.string "Interesting. That seems\n"
	.string "directed at situations like\l"
	.string "this. You and me and this\l"
	.string "endless healing cycle.\p"
	.string "I will pretend I didn't\l"
	.string "read that. Healed. Bye.$"

gText_NurseRandom_97::
	.string "You again. Let me run you\n"
	.string "through our emergency plan.\p"
	.string "Step one: stay calm. That is\n"
	.string "the most important part.\l"
	.string "Easier said than done.\p"
	.string "Step two: turn off machines.\n"
	.string "Unplug everything safely.\l"
	.string "Even the coffee maker.\p"
	.string "Step three: guide visitors\n"
	.string "to the nearest exit. That\l"
	.string "one. The one you can see.\p"
	.string "Step four: take CHANSEY and\n"
	.string "all medical supplies out.\l"
	.string "She knows the drill by now.\p"
	.string "Step five: call regional HQ.\n"
	.string "Their hold music is awful.\l"
	.string "You wait about fifteen mins.\p"
	.string "Step six: file a report.\n"
	.string "In triplicate. Of course.\l"
	.string "Healed. Hope that never happens.$"

gText_NurseRandom_98::
	.string "Hey. If I could give some\n"
	.string "life advice while I am here.\p"
	.string "First: eat actual meals.\n"
	.string "Not just vending machine\l"
	.string "snacks between battles.\p"
	.string "Second: sleep enough hours.\n"
	.string "Your body needs rest even\l"
	.string "if you feel fine today.\p"
	.string "Third: call your mom. She\n"
	.string "worries about you always.\l"
	.string "Even if you don't realize.\p"
	.string "Fourth: drink water. Lots.\n"
	.string "Carry a bottle with you.\l"
	.string "Dehydration is no joke.\p"
	.string "Fifth: take breaks. Sit on\n"
	.string "a bench. Watch the clouds.\l"
	.string "The world will not end if\l"
	.string "you stop battling an hour.\p"
	.string "Sixth: come here less often.\l"
	.string "Healed. Take care of you too.$"

gText_NurseRandom_99::
	.string "You know, I have said a lot\n"
	.string "of things during your many\l"
	.string "visits here over time.\p"
	.string "I have talked about weather,\n"
	.string "supply closets, my CHANSEY,\l"
	.string "broken coffee machines.\p"
	.string "I have shared stories about\n"
	.string "my commute, my apartment,\l"
	.string "my sister's wedding cake.\p"
	.string "I have discussed the machine,\n"
	.string "the building, the handbook,\l"
	.string "and my retirement plans.\p"
	.string "I have told you about my\n"
	.string "dreams, my doubts, and my\l"
	.string "thoughts on healing itself.\p"
	.string "And through all of that,\n"
	.string "you kept coming back here.\l"
	.string "Which means one of two\l"
	.string "things. You enjoy my talks.\l"
	.string "Or you really need to train.$"
